# deploy/vps/tor/torrc — /etc/tor/instances/velessbx/torrc (setup.sh).
#
# The sandboxes' way out. This host has one address of each family, and
# the owner's IRC client uses both, so a sandbox must not leave from
# either: veles.nft hands every IPv4 TCP connection a veles-sbx socket
# opens to this TransPort, and rejects the rest of their traffic. IRC
# (and every other site) sees a Tor exit.
#
# A client only. The instance defaults also open a world-writable SOCKS
# socket; nothing here needs it. DNS stays with the host resolver (pasta
# forwards a container's queries to it), so no DNSPort.
SocksPort 0
TransPort 127.0.0.1:9040
ClientOnly 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
